WEBVTT

00:03.169 --> 00:04.421
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.504 --> 00:05.797
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.880 --> 00:07.257
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.340 --> 00:08.508
Kids:  : Aye, aye,
Captain.
孩子们: : 是啊是啊
队长。

00:08.591 --> 00:11.428
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.511 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.348
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.432 --> 00:17.600
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.684 --> 00:19.269
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.273
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.481 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the
deck and flop like a fish ♪
队长：♪ 那么就降落在
像鱼一样翻牌和翻牌♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.985
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.068 --> 00:28.153
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.236 --> 00:29.571
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.654 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.658
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.742 --> 00:37.370
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:53.970 --> 00:55.722
SpongeBob:
May I help you, sir?
海绵宝宝：
先生，我可以帮你吗？

00:55.805 --> 00:57.223
I'd like  that  table
by the window.
我想要那张桌子
靠窗。

00:57.307 --> 00:59.350
As soon as the present
customers are done with it.
只要现在
客户已经完成了。

00:59.434 --> 01:00.852
They like to chew their
food thoroughly.
他们喜欢咀嚼自己的
食物彻底。

01:01.770 --> 01:06.149
97, 98, 99...
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……
97、98、99……

01:06.232 --> 01:07.942
Don't rush me, woman!
别催我，女人！

01:08.026 --> 01:10.820
Perhaps this will
speed up the process.
也许这会
加快进程。

01:10.904 --> 01:12.822
How will that help
them chew faster?
这有什么帮助
他们咀嚼得更快？

01:12.906 --> 01:14.407
SpongeBob, what's
the problem?
海绵宝宝，什么
问题是什么？

01:14.491 --> 01:15.825
No problem, I was just
telling this customer
没问题，我只是
告诉这位顾客

01:15.909 --> 01:17.702
he has to wait for his
favorite table.
他必须等待他的
最喜欢的桌子。

01:17.786 --> 01:20.330
Five bucks if I get
the table now.
如果我得到的话五块钱
现在的桌子。

01:20.413 --> 01:22.040
Ah...!
啊...！

01:22.123 --> 01:23.625
Oh, my hip.
哦，我的臀部。

01:23.917 --> 01:25.126
Enjoy your meal.
请享用。

01:25.210 --> 01:26.920
Let me know if you
need anything else.
让我知道如果你
还需要什么东西。

01:27.003 --> 01:28.755
Why did you give
him the table?
你为什么给
他那桌？

01:28.838 --> 01:32.675
You know what they say:
"money talks".
你知道他们怎么说：
“金钱万能”。

01:32.759 --> 01:34.177
I didn't know
money could talk.
我不知道
钱可以说话。

01:34.260 --> 01:36.054
Did it tell you to kick
those old people out?
它告诉你踢吗
那些老人出去了？

01:36.137 --> 01:38.097
What do you have
against old people?
你有什么
反对老人？

01:38.181 --> 01:40.016
Don't go goofy
on me, boy.
别傻了
在我身上，男孩。

01:40.099 --> 01:41.643
Money can't really talk.
钱真的不能说话。

01:41.726 --> 01:43.436
Only fish can talk.
只有鱼会说话。

01:43.520 --> 01:45.438
Wouldn't it be neat
if money could talk?
岂不是很整齐
如果钱会说话？

01:45.522 --> 01:46.940
Yeah.
是的。

01:47.023 --> 01:49.526
Wait a minute.
等一下。

01:50.276 --> 01:51.778
What's that music?
那是什么音乐？

01:51.861 --> 01:53.112
I think Mr. Krabs
is gonna sing.
我认为蟹老板
会唱歌。

01:53.196 --> 01:54.280
Oh, great.
哦，太好了。

01:54.364 --> 01:55.865
♪ If I could talk to money ♪
♪ 如果我能和钱说话 ♪

01:55.949 --> 01:57.742
♪ How great my life would be ♪
♪ 我的生活将会多么美好 ♪

01:57.826 --> 01:59.118
♪ We'd tell
each other secrets ♪
♪ 我们会告诉
彼此的秘密♪

01:59.202 --> 02:00.787
♪ All their friends
would visit me ♪
♪ 他们所有的朋友
会来看我♪

02:00.870 --> 02:02.330
♪ I'd bathe in filthy riches ♪
♪ 我会沐浴在肮脏的财富中 ♪

02:02.413 --> 02:03.957
♪ Which is clean
enough for me ♪
♪ 哪个是干净的
对我来说足够了♪

02:04.040 --> 02:05.750
♪ Oh, if you could tell
me what you want ♪
♪ 哦，如果你能告诉的话
我你想要什么♪

02:05.834 --> 02:08.545
♪ How happy we would be ♪
♪ 我们会多么幸福 ♪

02:08.628 --> 02:10.630
♪ We'd surely
be the best of friends ♪
♪ 我们肯定会
成为最好的朋友♪

02:10.713 --> 02:11.965
♪ We'd never disagree ♪
♪ 我们永远不会有分歧 ♪

02:12.048 --> 02:13.424
♪ There couldn't be
a downside ♪
♪ 不可能有
缺点♪

02:13.508 --> 02:14.968
♪ Not one that I could see ♪
♪ 我看不见的人 ♪

02:15.051 --> 02:16.845
♪ If I could talk to money ♪
♪ 如果我能和钱说话 ♪

02:16.928 --> 02:18.638
♪ Come along, sing with me ♪
♪ 来和我一起唱歌 ♪

02:18.721 --> 02:20.598
Uh, no thanks,
I got to go.
呃，不用了，谢谢，
我得走了。

02:20.682 --> 02:21.891
I really have to pee.
我真的要尿尿。

02:21.975 --> 02:23.309
♪ If I could talk to money ♪
♪ 如果我能和钱说话 ♪

02:23.393 --> 02:27.897
♪ And it could talk to me... ♪
♪ 它可以跟我说话...... ♪

02:27.981 --> 02:29.774
♪ We'd always
be the best of friends ♪
♪ 我们总是
成为最好的朋友♪

02:29.858 --> 02:33.111
♪ For all eternity ♪
♪ 永远 ♪

02:35.572 --> 02:36.823
What did I miss?
我错过了什么？

02:36.906 --> 02:38.241
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

02:38.324 --> 02:39.784
♪ If I could talk to money ♪
♪ 如果我能和钱说话 ♪

02:39.868 --> 02:41.327
♪ How great my life... ♪
♪ 我的生活多么美好...♪

02:41.411 --> 02:43.538
Parlez vous Francais?
Parlez vous 法国人？

02:43.621 --> 02:44.998
Hable espanol?
哈布尔西班牙语？

02:45.081 --> 02:48.001
Oo-yay eak-spay
ig-pay atin-lay?
哦耶 eak-spay
ig-pay atin-lay？

02:48.084 --> 02:49.127
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

02:49.210 --> 02:51.045
Maybe this will make you talk.
也许这会让你说话。

02:51.129 --> 02:52.505
Talk!
讲话！

02:52.589 --> 02:54.340
You're bein' too hard
on the little guy.
你太难了
在小家伙身上。

02:54.424 --> 02:56.050
You can talk to me.
你可以和我谈谈。

02:56.134 --> 02:58.011
I'm your friend.
我是你的朋友。

02:59.512 --> 03:01.973
I would give anything
to talk to money.
我愿意付出一切
与金钱交谈。

03:02.056 --> 03:03.600
Anything!
任何事物！

03:05.268 --> 03:06.477
Anything?
任何事物？

03:06.561 --> 03:07.520
You?
你？

03:07.604 --> 03:09.022
That's right.
这是正确的。

03:09.105 --> 03:12.191
'Tis I, the ominous
Flying Dutchman.
这就是我，不祥的
飞翔的荷兰人.

03:12.275 --> 03:14.193
I'll grant your wish.
我会满足你的愿望。

03:14.277 --> 03:16.863
But it'll cost you.
但这会让你付出代价。

03:16.946 --> 03:18.948
Yeah, yeah, my
immortal soul.
是啊是啊我的
不朽的灵魂。

03:19.032 --> 03:20.533
I've heard
that speech before.
我听说过
之前那个演讲。

03:20.617 --> 03:21.618
Wha...?
世界卫生大会...？

03:21.701 --> 03:23.161
Well, uh, great.
嗯，太好了。

03:23.244 --> 03:24.954
But be warned!
但请注意！

03:25.038 --> 03:26.414
Yeah, yeah, skip
the lecture.
是啊是啊，跳过
讲座。

03:26.497 --> 03:27.999
I want what's
coming to me.
我想要什么
来找我。

03:28.082 --> 03:31.210
Humph, you're no fun
at all, you know that?
哼，你不好玩
无论如何，你知道吗？

03:31.294 --> 03:32.587
Hey, is that pixie dust?
嘿，那是仙尘吗？

03:35.715 --> 03:37.634
Uh, uh.
呃，呃。

03:39.135 --> 03:41.346
Ooh, that was a strange dream.
哦，那是一个奇怪的梦。

03:41.429 --> 03:43.389
Male voice: You think that was
a strange dream?
男声：你以为那是
一个奇怪的梦？

03:43.473 --> 03:46.059
I dreamt I was trapped in a
prison made of peanut butter.
我梦见自己被困在一个
用花生酱做的监狱。

03:46.142 --> 03:47.769
Who said that?
谁说的？

03:47.852 --> 03:49.395
Hey, it's a nickel.
嘿，这是一个五分钱。

03:49.479 --> 03:52.398
What were you doing in my belly
button, little fella?
你在我肚子里做什么
按钮，小家伙？

03:52.482 --> 03:55.944
I got stuck in there during
your last coin shower.
期间我被困在那里
你最后一次投币淋浴。

03:56.027 --> 03:57.737
I don't want
to talk about it.
我不想要
谈论它。

03:59.656 --> 04:01.407
Do  you  have anything
to say to me?
你有什么吗
对我说？

04:01.491 --> 04:04.327
Yeah, when's the last
time you brushed your teeth?
是的，最后一次是什么时候
你什么时候刷牙？

04:04.410 --> 04:05.745
Oh, it worked.
哦，成功了。

04:05.828 --> 04:08.247
I can talk to money.
我可以和钱说话。

04:08.331 --> 04:09.916
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

04:09.999 --> 04:13.211
Please, don't start
singing again.
请不要开始
再次唱歌。

04:13.294 --> 04:14.712
Don't worry, darlings.
别担心，亲爱的。

04:14.796 --> 04:17.590
Soon you'll be rejoined
with all your friends.
很快你就会重新加入
和你所有的朋友。

04:19.092 --> 04:21.594
Oh, my, why don't you
kiss me like that?
哦，我的天，你为什么不呢？
就这样吻我吗？

04:21.678 --> 04:22.720
Don't start.
不要开始。

04:22.804 --> 04:25.473
That'll be $5.
那将是 5 美元。

04:25.556 --> 04:26.557
Hey, dudes.
嘿，伙计们。

04:26.641 --> 04:28.226
Run, jump!
跑、跳！

04:28.309 --> 04:30.228
Jump out, jump out!
跳出来，跳出来！

04:32.563 --> 04:35.483
Good morning, my darlings.
早上好，亲爱的。

04:35.566 --> 04:37.944
Money: Good morning, Mr. Krabs.
Money：早上好，蟹老板。

04:38.027 --> 04:40.613
You're coming home with me.
你要和我一起回家。

04:40.697 --> 04:42.365
Money: Yay!
钱：耶！

04:42.448 --> 04:44.283
SpongeBob, I did it.
海绵宝宝，我做到了。

04:44.367 --> 04:46.119
I can talk to money.
我可以和钱说话。

04:46.202 --> 04:47.245
Go ahead, say hello.
来吧，打个招呼。

04:47.328 --> 04:50.081
Hello... money.
你好……钱。

04:51.833 --> 04:54.669
Oh, aren't they a riot?
哦，他们不是骚乱吗？

04:54.752 --> 04:57.171
I'm really starting
to worry about Mr. Krabs.
我真的开始了
担心蟹老板。

04:57.255 --> 05:00.466
I'm worried he just
left with my paycheck.
我担心他只是
留下了我的薪水。

05:00.550 --> 05:04.053
Now that we're alone, let's
tell each other secrets.
既然我们都孤单了，那就让我们
告诉彼此秘密。

05:04.137 --> 05:06.472
What kind of secrets
are you talking about?
什么样的秘密
你在说什么？

05:06.556 --> 05:08.057
Yeah, we live
in a safe.
是的，我们住
在保险箱里。

05:08.141 --> 05:09.892
You got any friends you
could invite over?
你有朋友吗
可以邀请过来吗？

05:09.976 --> 05:11.894
Aren't we enough for you?
我们还不够你吗？

05:11.978 --> 05:13.146
What's wrong with us?
我们怎么了？

05:13.229 --> 05:14.439
Money: Yeah!
钱：是啊！

05:14.522 --> 05:16.274
Nothing, nothing,
you guys are great.
没什么，没什么，
你们太棒了。

05:16.357 --> 05:19.027
I thought you guys might
want some company
我以为你们可能
想要有人陪伴

05:19.110 --> 05:20.820
you know, to make
you happy.
你知道，为了使
你快乐。

05:20.903 --> 05:24.657
Money: Why don't you ask what
would make us happy?
钱：你为什么不问什么
会让我们快乐吗？

05:24.741 --> 05:28.411
OK, so how can
I make you happy?
好吧，那怎么办
我让你幸福吗？

05:28.494 --> 05:29.704
Money: Spend us.
钱：花我们。

05:29.787 --> 05:31.039
We're money.
我们是钱。

05:31.122 --> 05:32.415
It's in our nature.
这是我们的本性。

05:32.498 --> 05:34.334
I've been trapped in that safe
for eight years.
我被困在那个保险箱里
八年了。

05:34.417 --> 05:38.379
I always wanted to be spent
on a fairy princess outfit.
我一直想被花掉
穿着仙女公主装。

05:38.463 --> 05:39.672
What? No way.
什么？决不。

05:39.756 --> 05:42.300
I want to be
spent on corn dogs.
我想成为
花在玉米热狗上。

05:42.383 --> 05:44.343
I want to be spent
on diapers.
我想被花掉
在尿布上。

05:44.427 --> 05:46.679
Money: Yeah, yeah, me too.
钱：是啊是啊，我也是。

05:46.763 --> 05:48.181
Oh, wait a minute.
哦，等一下。

05:48.264 --> 05:50.433
I am not spending you
on corn dogs, diapers
我不花钱你
在玉米热狗、尿布上

05:50.516 --> 05:53.394
or fairy princess outfits.
或童话公主服装。

05:53.728 --> 05:55.855
Woman: Did you
find everything OK?
女：你有吗
发现一切正常吗？

05:55.938 --> 05:57.857
Unfortunately.
很遗憾。

05:57.940 --> 05:59.859
Money: Yeah, all right.
钱：是啊，好吧。

06:01.402 --> 06:03.738
Mr. Krabs,
lookin' good.
蟹老板先生，
看起来不错。

06:05.198 --> 06:06.449
What's wrong
with Mr. Krabs?
怎么了
和蟹老板一起？

06:06.532 --> 06:07.867
I don't know.
我不知道。

06:07.950 --> 06:09.869
He's acting
kind of weird.
他在演戏
有点奇怪。

06:09.952 --> 06:12.205
Money:  :
Spend us.
钱: :
花我们吧

06:12.288 --> 06:14.332
Spend us.
花我们吧

06:14.415 --> 06:16.918
Spend us.
花我们吧

06:17.001 --> 06:18.711
I can't spend all of you.
我不能花掉你们的全部。

06:18.795 --> 06:21.214
And none of you want
to be spent on stuff I want.
你们谁也不想要
花在我想要的东西上。

06:21.297 --> 06:23.800
Money: Spend us.
钱：花我们。

06:23.883 --> 06:26.552
Ah, you're all shallow
and self-absorbed.
啊，你们都是浅薄的
和自我陶醉。

06:26.636 --> 06:28.471
What did I ever see in you?
我在你身上看到了什么？

06:28.554 --> 06:30.473
Money: Spend us.
钱：花我们。

06:30.556 --> 06:32.350
I'm not listening.
我不听。

06:32.433 --> 06:34.143
Money: Spend us.
钱：花我们。

06:34.227 --> 06:36.062
I'm not...
我不是...

06:36.145 --> 06:37.146
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

06:37.230 --> 06:38.314
Hi, Mr. Krabs.
嗨，蟹老板。

06:38.397 --> 06:39.565
I just came by to make
sure you weren't
我只是过来做
当然你不是

06:39.649 --> 06:40.733
you know, totally insane.
你知道，完全疯了。

06:42.235 --> 06:45.279
Take this bag as far away
as possible and bury it.
带着这个包走得尽可能远
尽可能地把它埋起来。

06:47.240 --> 06:48.908
Ooh, ooh-
what have I done?
噢噢——
我做了什么？

06:48.991 --> 06:51.577
Give me that back.
把那个还给我。

06:51.661 --> 06:54.372
OK, glad you're
not insane.
好的，很高兴你
没疯。

06:54.455 --> 06:56.582
Dutchman,
you cheated me.
荷兰人,
你欺骗了我。

06:56.666 --> 06:59.752
Take this horrible curse away.
把这个可怕的诅咒拿走吧。

06:59.836 --> 07:02.088
I want a refund.
我想要退款。

07:02.171 --> 07:05.133
All sales are final
from the Flying Dutchman
所有销售都是最终的
来自飞翔的荷兰人号

07:05.216 --> 07:08.177
especially for a selfish
shellfish like yourself.
尤其对于一个自私的人来说
像你一样的贝类。

07:08.261 --> 07:10.138
Try saying that three
times fast.
试着说三
倍快。

07:10.221 --> 07:12.640
Your soul's going in
me fanny pack of despair.
你的灵魂要进去
我绝望的腰包。

07:13.808 --> 07:16.102
Now pay up.
现在付钱吧。

07:16.185 --> 07:17.311
Huh?
啊？

07:17.395 --> 07:19.021
An I.O.U.?
欠条？

07:19.105 --> 07:22.275
Hee-hee, yeah, well, I sort of
sold my soul already.
嘻嘻，是啊，我有点
已经出卖了我的灵魂。

07:22.358 --> 07:24.110
What? To who?
什么？给谁？

07:24.193 --> 07:25.194
Those guys.
那些家伙。

07:25.278 --> 07:27.780
We were here
first, Pops.
我们在这里
首先，波普斯。

07:27.864 --> 07:30.658
We've all got a claim
on Krabs' soul.
我们都有索赔
蟹蟹的灵魂。

07:30.741 --> 07:32.785
Get to the back
of the line.
到后面去
的线。

07:32.869 --> 07:36.122
Now, now, I'm sure we
can sort this out.
现在，现在，我确信我们
可以解决这个问题。

07:38.708 --> 07:40.626
You too, SpongeBob?
你也是吗，海绵宝宝？

07:40.710 --> 07:42.461
He was $5
short on payday.
他当时是5美元
发薪日短缺。

07:55.057 --> 07:56.559
Narrator:  Ahoy, mateys.
旁白：嘿，伙计们。

07:56.767 --> 07:59.478
Today I'll be spinning a tale
you won't soon forget.
今天我要编一个故事
你不会很快忘记的。

07:59.562 --> 08:03.149
It's called SpongeBob
SquarePants vs. The Patty
Gadget.
它的名字叫海绵宝宝
方裤 vs 帕蒂
小工具。

08:03.232 --> 08:05.151
Now SpongeBob was working.
现在海绵宝宝正在工作。

08:05.234 --> 08:06.819
his eye on the grill
他的眼睛盯着烤架

08:06.903 --> 08:09.488
till he heard a sharp sound
that gave him a chill.
直到他听到一声尖锐的声音
这让他不寒而栗。

08:09.572 --> 08:10.489
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

08:10.573 --> 08:11.991
What could it mean?
这意味着什么？

08:12.074 --> 08:14.368
Wow, it's a deep-fry patty
cookin' machine.
哇，这是炸肉饼
烹饪机。

08:15.786 --> 08:17.705
And hiding behind it,
who do we see?
并躲在它的背后，
我们看到谁？

08:17.788 --> 08:19.248
None other than Squidward
不是别人，正是章鱼哥

08:19.332 --> 08:21.167
and his bad face acne.
还有他那张糟糕的脸上的痘痘。

08:21.250 --> 08:24.378
What is this contraption you've
hauled into me place?
你的这个装置是什么？
拖到我的地方？

08:24.462 --> 08:25.838
A miracle, a marvel.
一个奇迹，一个奇迹。

08:25.922 --> 08:28.174
It will cook Krabby Patties
at a fabulous pace.
它会煮蟹肉饼
以惊人的速度。

08:28.257 --> 08:29.467
But how are
the patties?
但怎么样
肉饼？

08:29.550 --> 08:30.676
I mean, how do they taste?
我的意思是，它们味道如何？

08:30.760 --> 08:32.136
I'll let you try one.
我会让你尝试一个。

08:32.220 --> 08:34.847
Shove this in your face.
把这个推到你脸上。

08:34.931 --> 08:36.515
I have to admit that patty
was yummy.
我不得不承认帕蒂
很好吃。

08:36.599 --> 08:39.477
Though it sits like a rock
when it lands in me tummy.
虽然它像岩石一样坐着
当它落在我肚子里的时候。

08:39.560 --> 08:40.853
But I've got me a fry cook
但我有一个炒菜厨师

08:40.937 --> 08:42.146
and he's always on time.
他总是准时。

08:42.230 --> 08:44.023
Ah, but this gizmo is faster
啊，但是这个小玩意更快

08:44.106 --> 08:45.483
and you won't pay it a dime.
而且你不会付一毛钱。

08:45.566 --> 08:47.068
Your machine sounds
delightful
你的机器发出声音
令人愉快的

08:47.151 --> 08:48.569
but how much does it cost?
但要花多少钱？

08:48.653 --> 08:50.529
Hmm, just fire SpongeBob
嗯，就解雇海绵宝宝吧

08:50.613 --> 08:52.198
and tell him get lost.
并告诉他滚开。

08:52.281 --> 08:54.742
The machine wanted his
job to make SpongeBob quit
机器想要他的
让海绵宝宝退出的工作

08:54.825 --> 08:56.494
and SpongeBob didn't like it.
海绵宝宝不喜欢它。

08:56.577 --> 08:58.412
No, not one bit.
不，一点也没有。

08:58.496 --> 09:01.499
Pushing his grill, SpongeBob
burst through the door.
海绵宝宝推着他的烤架
破门而入。

09:01.582 --> 09:03.084
I challenge your gadget.
我挑战你的小工具。

09:03.167 --> 09:05.378
I declare patty war.
我向帕蒂宣战。

09:05.461 --> 09:08.297
With three little words,
Krabs started the show.
简单的三个字，
螃蟹开始表演。

09:08.381 --> 09:10.424
Flag raised in the air,
he cried
旗帜在空中升起，
他哭了

09:10.508 --> 09:12.718
ready, set, go...!
准备好，出发，出发……！

09:12.802 --> 09:15.054
Quick as a flash, Squidward
pulled the big lever.
快如闪电，章鱼哥
拉动大杠杆。

09:15.137 --> 09:18.057
Then sat back and watched,
feeling, oh, so quite clever.
然后坐下来观看，
感觉哦，真是太聪明了。

09:18.140 --> 09:20.977
SpongeBob with spatula
held tight in his fist,
海绵宝宝用抹刀
紧紧握在拳头里，

09:21.060 --> 09:23.521
flung 20 patties,
not a single one missed.
扔20个肉饼，
没有一个错过。

09:23.604 --> 09:25.523
The crowd was impressed.
众人印象深刻。

09:25.606 --> 09:26.774
Wow!
哇！

09:26.857 --> 09:28.442
They cheered full of glee.
他们欢呼雀跃。

09:28.526 --> 09:30.319
All except Patrick,
who had to go pee.
除了帕特里克之外，所有人
谁必须去撒尿。

09:30.403 --> 09:32.446
A noise and a clatter
came from the machine.
一阵噪音和咔嗒声
来自机器。

09:32.530 --> 09:35.574
And out popped the patties
in a burst of hot steam.
然后肉饼就出来了
一阵热气中。

09:35.658 --> 09:36.742
The gadget was fast.
这个小工具速度很快。

09:36.826 --> 09:38.577
Its first batch completed.
第一批已完成。

09:38.661 --> 09:39.996
But SpongeBob yelled out
但海绵宝宝大声喊道

09:40.079 --> 09:41.747
"I won't be defeated"!
“我不会被打败”！

09:41.831 --> 09:43.332
He took in some air.
他吸了一口气。

09:43.416 --> 09:45.126
SpongeBob swelled his physique.
海绵宝宝的体格膨胀了。

09:45.209 --> 09:47.628
Then dozens of patties filled
up his cheeks.
然后填了几十个肉饼
抬起他的脸颊。

09:47.712 --> 09:49.630
He strained and he sweated.
他使劲用力，出了汗。

09:49.714 --> 09:51.382
He summoned his will.
他召唤出了自己的意志。

09:51.465 --> 09:53.592
And shot Krabby Patties,
right onto the grill.
并拍摄了蟹肉饼，
就在烤架上。

09:53.676 --> 09:54.635
"Not bad"
“不错”

09:54.719 --> 09:55.928
Yelled out Squidward.
章鱼哥大声喊道。

09:56.012 --> 09:57.596
A really good try.
真是一次很好的尝试。

09:57.680 --> 10:00.182
But let's see how you do
against my machine
set on high.
但让我们看看你怎么做
针对我的机器
设置为高。

10:00.266 --> 10:01.642
The gizmo, it shuddered.
这个小玩意，它颤抖着。

10:01.726 --> 10:03.352
It clattered, it shook.
它叮当响，它摇晃。

10:03.436 --> 10:04.854
And as Squidward laughed:
章鱼哥大笑道：

10:04.937 --> 10:06.605
Sandy said:
桑迪说：

10:06.689 --> 10:08.566
But ol' SpongeBob cried out
但海绵宝宝却大喊大叫

10:08.649 --> 10:10.359
"I won't lose to that thing"!
“我不会输给那个东西的”！

10:10.443 --> 10:12.111
Then he raised up two
spatulas
然后他举起了两个
铲子

10:12.194 --> 10:13.696
and leapt like a spring.
并像弹簧一样跳跃。

10:13.779 --> 10:15.531
His hands were a blur,
the patties went flying.
他的手已经模糊了
肉饼飞了起来。

10:15.615 --> 10:17.491
He fried up a hundred
without even trying.
他炒了一百个
甚至没有尝试。

10:17.575 --> 10:20.411
Squidward was worried,
SpongeBob couldn't be beat.
章鱼哥很担心，
海绵宝宝是无法被击败的。

10:20.494 --> 10:22.371
I got one last chance,
I'll turn up the heat.
我还有最后一次机会
我会把暖气调高。

10:22.455 --> 10:24.373
He struggled and strained
他挣扎着、紧张着

10:24.457 --> 10:25.833
till his face turned dark blue.
直到他的脸变成深蓝色。

10:25.916 --> 10:27.585
Then the lever moved forward
然后杠杆向前移动

10:27.668 --> 10:29.170
and broke right in two.
并断成两半。

10:29.253 --> 10:30.713
The gadget buckled and sparked.
这个小玩意弯曲并冒出火花。

10:30.796 --> 10:32.340
It cracked like a gun.
它像枪一样破裂。

10:32.423 --> 10:34.133
So Squidward took off
yelling
于是章鱼哥就起飞了
大喊大叫

10:34.216 --> 10:35.843
"Let me know if I've won".
“如果我赢了请告诉我”。

10:35.926 --> 10:37.595
Lightning flew from its maw.
闪电从它的肚子里飞了出来。

10:37.678 --> 10:39.472
It looked ready to burst.
它看起来快要爆炸了。

10:39.555 --> 10:42.141
But SpongeBob, still
standing, yelled
但海绵宝宝，依然
站着，大喊

10:42.224 --> 10:44.226
"foul beast, do your worst".
“邪恶的野兽，尽你所能”。

10:44.310 --> 10:47.563
The patties came flying
by twos and by threes.
肉饼飞来了
三三两两。

10:47.646 --> 10:50.232
By dozens, by hundreds,
oh, it was something to see.
数十个、数百个，
哦，这是值得一看的东西。

10:50.316 --> 10:51.734
Aye, that machine, it was fast.
是的，那台机器，速度很快。

10:51.817 --> 10:53.402
But SpongeBob was faster.
但海绵宝宝更快。

10:53.486 --> 10:55.988
He'd prove to that thing
that he was its master.
他会证明那件事
他是它的主人。

10:56.072 --> 10:59.617
The gadget blew into bits
and died with a boom.
这个小工具被炸成了碎片
并轰然死去。

10:59.700 --> 11:01.160
The blast was so loud
爆炸声是如此之大

11:01.243 --> 11:02.328
it woke King Neptune.
它唤醒了海王星国王。

11:02.411 --> 11:03.704
: What's that?
: 那是什么？

11:03.788 --> 11:05.998
It was all over,
finished and done.
一切都结束了，
完成并完成。

11:06.082 --> 11:07.500
With his head
held up high
用他的头
高举

11:07.583 --> 11:09.835
SpongeBob knew he had won.
海绵宝宝知道他赢了。

11:09.919 --> 11:11.754
The crowd yelled, "hooray
众人高呼：“万岁

11:11.837 --> 11:14.298
Squidward's name is now mud"!
章鱼哥的名字现在是泥”！

11:14.382 --> 11:15.424
But as they were cheering
但正当他们欢呼雀跃时

11:15.508 --> 11:17.176
SpongeBob fell with a thud.
海绵宝宝重重地摔倒了。

11:17.259 --> 11:18.844
SpongeBob: Unh.
海绵宝宝：呃。

11:18.928 --> 11:20.513
The service was short.
服务时间很短。

11:20.596 --> 11:23.516
Tears shed with regret.
流下遗憾的泪水。

11:23.599 --> 11:26.352
Squidward, it seemed, was
the one most upset.
章鱼哥，看起来，是
最心烦意乱的人。

11:30.606 --> 11:32.066
Whoo, yeah!
呼，是啊！

11:32.149 --> 11:33.609
What's that?
那是什么？

11:33.692 --> 11:35.903
You thought SpongeBob was
buried down there?
你以为海绵宝宝是
埋在那里？

11:35.986 --> 11:37.697
They just buried the gadget
他们刚刚埋了这个小玩意

11:37.780 --> 11:39.448
Ha-ha, this I swear.
哈哈，我发誓。

11:39.532 --> 11:42.576
Well, that ends me tale,
straight from the book.
好吧，我的故事到此结束，
直接从书中。

11:42.660 --> 11:44.370
Now I got to go
and polish me hook.
现在我得走了
并擦亮我的钩子。

11:59.218 --> 12:00.678
Well, Squidward, ol' boy
嗯，章鱼哥，老男孩

12:00.761 --> 12:03.681
all that's left is to go win
that dancing trophy
剩下的就是去赢
那个跳舞奖杯

12:03.764 --> 12:05.349
and give it a home.
并给它一个家。

12:05.433 --> 12:09.311
After all, nobody ever worked
harder to get it than you.
毕竟没人工作过
比你更难得到它。

12:10.771 --> 12:12.773
All those years of training
with the masters.
这么多年的训练
与大师们。

12:12.857 --> 12:15.484
Your tireless effort to keep
your instrument supple.
你孜孜不倦的努力保持着
你的乐器柔软。

12:15.568 --> 12:19.280
Not to mention your weekly
thigh waxing.
更不用说你的每周
大腿打蜡。

12:19.363 --> 12:22.408
And now it's time
to go get it.
现在是时候了
去拿它。

12:22.491 --> 12:23.868
So, let's do it.
那么，让我们开始吧。

12:23.951 --> 12:25.494
Whoo...!
呼...！

12:27.746 --> 12:29.415
Tsk, tsk, tsk, tsk.
啧，啧，啧，啧。

12:29.498 --> 12:31.417
Want to give me a ruling,
SpongeBob?
想要给我一个裁决，
海绵宝宝？

12:31.500 --> 12:33.878
Sorry, Squidward,
you got to go lower to win.
对不起，章鱼哥，
你必须降低才能获胜。

12:33.961 --> 12:35.087
What?
什么？

12:35.171 --> 12:36.255
What are you two doing?
你们两个在做什么？

12:36.338 --> 12:37.715
We're limbo dancing
我们在地狱之舞

12:37.798 --> 12:39.300
to get ready for the
dance-a-thon auditions.
为
舞蹈马拉松试镜。

12:39.383 --> 12:40.676
We're gonna win the trophy.
我们会赢得奖杯。

12:40.759 --> 12:42.761
Ha, the two of you?
哈，你们两个？

12:42.845 --> 12:44.680
Don't make me laugh.
别让我笑。

12:44.763 --> 12:46.015
Come here...
See that?
来这里...
看到了吗？

12:46.098 --> 12:47.850
That's where
the trophy's going.
那就是那里
奖杯就要出发了。

12:47.933 --> 12:50.144
Ooh...
哦...

12:50.227 --> 12:53.105
You built us a trophy case
for when we win?
你为我们打造了一个奖杯柜
我们什么时候赢？

12:53.189 --> 12:54.774
Oh, you are a true friend.
哦，你是一个真正的朋友。

12:54.857 --> 12:56.567
No, you twits.
不，你们这些笨蛋。

12:56.650 --> 12:59.570
I built that trophy case
for me when  I  win.
我建造了那个奖杯柜
当我获胜时对我来说。

12:59.653 --> 13:02.031
I'm going to ace
the tryouts today
我要成为王牌
今天的选拔赛

13:02.114 --> 13:04.033
and then I'm going
to the finals tomorrow
然后我要去
到明天的决赛

13:04.116 --> 13:05.576
and win the trophy.
并赢得奖杯。

13:05.659 --> 13:08.913
I am going forth to meet
my destiny.
我要出去迎接
我的命运。

13:08.996 --> 13:10.664
Good-bye.
再见。

13:12.124 --> 13:13.501
Ruling, SpongeBob?
裁决，海绵宝宝？

13:13.584 --> 13:15.503
I think we better
raise the bar.
我认为我们更好
提高标准。

13:22.593 --> 13:23.636
Hiya, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

13:23.719 --> 13:25.304
Oh, great.
哦，太好了。

13:25.387 --> 13:26.931
The Flying Gavonne Brothers.
飞翔的加冯兄弟。

13:27.014 --> 13:29.099
Just ignore them, Squidward.
别理他们，章鱼哥。

13:29.183 --> 13:32.645
Female:  :
Contestants 51 and 52
to the stage, please.
女: :
参赛者51和52
请上台。

13:32.728 --> 13:33.646
We're up, Patrick.
我们起来了，帕特里克。

13:33.729 --> 13:35.648
Wish us luck, Squidward.
祝我们好运，章鱼哥。

13:35.731 --> 13:36.774
Do I know you?
我知道你？

13:36.857 --> 13:38.817
You kidder.
你个小鬼。

13:38.901 --> 13:40.486
Let's go, Patrick.
我们走吧，帕特里克。

13:40.569 --> 13:43.322
Poor boobs, they don't
stand a chance.
可怜的胸部，他们没有
有机会。

13:45.574 --> 13:46.659
Yell, see you at the finals,
Squidward.
呐喊，决赛见
章鱼哥。

13:46.742 --> 13:47.868
You actually got in?
你真的进去了？

13:47.952 --> 13:49.453
Yep.
是的。

13:49.537 --> 13:51.664
Humph, if those two
nitwits made it
哼，如果那两个
白痴做到了

13:51.747 --> 13:53.791
then I'm a shoo-in.
那我就稳操胜券了。

13:53.874 --> 13:56.252
Female:  :
Contestant 53 to the stage,
please.
女: :
53号选手上台，
请。

13:56.335 --> 13:58.212
Look out, dancing world
小心，舞蹈的世界

13:58.295 --> 13:59.838
here comes your future.
你的未来来了。

14:02.216 --> 14:03.968
Music, please.
请听音乐。

14:18.524 --> 14:19.692
Male Judge: Next.
男评委：下一位。

14:19.775 --> 14:20.693
Excuse me?
打扰一下？

14:20.776 --> 14:21.777
You're done.
你完成了。

14:21.860 --> 14:23.529
You know, next contestant.
你知道，下一位参赛者。

14:23.612 --> 14:25.531
You didn't make the cut,
sorry, Mac.
你没有晋级，
对不起，麦克。

14:25.614 --> 14:27.116
But, but, but, but,
you don't understand.
但是，但是，但是，但是，
你不明白。

14:27.199 --> 14:29.868
I, I, I already built
a trophy case
我我我已经建好了
奖杯箱

14:29.952 --> 14:31.620
with the cutest little plaque.
带着最可爱的小牌匾。

14:31.704 --> 14:34.540
If I could just, just,
just touch it.
如果我可以，只是，
只需触摸它即可。

14:34.623 --> 14:36.709
Squidward: But I, hey...
章鱼哥：但是我，嘿……

14:36.792 --> 14:37.918
Unhand me, you brutes.
放开我，你们这些畜生。

14:38.002 --> 14:39.587
Ah!
啊!

14:45.593 --> 14:47.386
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

14:47.469 --> 14:49.597
You're just not getting
into the spirit of this
thing, Squidward.
你只是没有得到
本着这个精神
事情，章鱼哥。

14:49.680 --> 14:50.806
Doh, help me up.
呵呵，扶我起来吧。

14:50.889 --> 14:52.641
How'd the audition go,
Squidward?
试镜怎么样，
章鱼哥？

14:52.725 --> 14:54.602
The audition?
试镜？

14:54.685 --> 14:57.146
My trophy?
我的奖杯？

15:00.816 --> 15:02.693
I mean, uh, uh...
我的意思是，呃，呃……

15:02.776 --> 15:04.737
Yeah, the audition.
是的，试镜。

15:04.820 --> 15:09.575
Evidently,
I'm such a great dancer
显然，
我是一个很棒的舞者

15:09.658 --> 15:13.829
that I've been banned from
the competition for life.
我被禁止了
生命的竞争。

15:13.912 --> 15:16.290
Whoa.
哇哦。

15:16.373 --> 15:17.750
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

15:17.833 --> 15:19.752
Would you be our coach
for the finals?
你愿意当我们的教练吗
为了决赛？

15:19.835 --> 15:21.253
What?
什么？

15:21.337 --> 15:23.464
I've got better things to do
than help you two dopes.
我还有更重要的事情要做
还不如帮助你们两个笨蛋。

15:23.547 --> 15:26.550
Like polishing your empty
trophy case?
就像擦亮你的空虚
奖杯盒？

15:26.634 --> 15:27.885
Fine.
美好的。

15:27.968 --> 15:30.763
But I keep the trophy
when we win, deal?
但奖杯我保留着
当我们赢了，交易？

15:30.846 --> 15:31.930
Deal.
交易。

15:32.014 --> 15:33.390
OK.
好的。

15:33.474 --> 15:34.642
Show me what you
got, Patrick.
让我看看你是什么
得到了，帕特里克。

15:34.725 --> 15:36.060
OK, here I go.
好的，我开始了。

15:36.143 --> 15:38.854
Watch me now.
现在看着我。

15:38.937 --> 15:40.898
Ooh, cramp!
噢，抽筋了！

15:46.695 --> 15:49.239
Well, I guess that
just leaves you, SpongeBob.
嗯，我想是这样
就离开你了，海绵宝宝。

15:49.323 --> 15:50.699
Show me your stuff.
给我看看你的东西。

15:50.783 --> 15:52.868
Ready, and...
准备好了，然后...

16:04.672 --> 16:05.756
Having fun?
玩得开心吗？

16:05.839 --> 16:08.217
Yes, yes, I am.
是的，是的，我是。

16:08.300 --> 16:11.804
SpongeBob, dancing isn't
supposed to be fun.
海绵宝宝，跳舞不是
应该很有趣。

16:11.887 --> 16:13.931
It's supposed to be art
应该是艺术

16:14.014 --> 16:15.641
and art is suffering!
而艺术就是受苦！

16:15.724 --> 16:18.644
Now, we'll start
with some ballet.
现在，我们开始
一些芭蕾舞。

16:18.727 --> 16:20.813
Watch my feet
and follow my lead.
注意我的脚
并跟随我的带领。

16:20.896 --> 16:24.692
Ready, and plie.
准备好了，开始吧。

16:24.775 --> 16:25.859
Releve.
释放。

16:25.943 --> 16:27.778
And now, grand jete-
现在，大喷气机-

16:27.861 --> 16:29.822
ahh...
啊...

16:29.905 --> 16:32.408
Oh, where am I?
噢，我在哪儿？

16:32.491 --> 16:34.118
See if I can find the lights.
看看能不能找到灯。

16:35.661 --> 16:37.162
Ah...!
啊...！

16:38.455 --> 16:40.666
Squidward: Wait a minute.
章鱼哥：等一下。

16:40.749 --> 16:41.917
Oh!
哦！

16:42.000 --> 16:43.335
Squidward: This gives
me an idea.
章鱼哥：这给了
我有一个想法。

16:43.419 --> 16:44.712
Ready, SpongeBob?
准备好了吗，海绵宝宝？

16:44.795 --> 16:45.838
Ready.
准备好。

16:45.921 --> 16:48.841
A one and a two, and plie.
一个一，一个二，还有层。

16:48.924 --> 16:49.842
Jete.
杰特。

16:49.925 --> 16:50.926
Releve.
释放。

16:51.009 --> 16:52.344
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

16:52.428 --> 16:53.554
This will
never work.
这将
从来不工作。

16:53.637 --> 16:54.847
You've got two left feet.
你有两只左脚。

16:54.930 --> 16:56.014
SpongeBob: How'd you know?
海绵宝宝：你怎么知道？

16:56.098 --> 16:57.182
Squidward: Give me those.
章鱼哥：把那些给我。

16:57.266 --> 16:58.517
Unh...
呃……

16:58.600 --> 16:59.852
That's better.
这样更好。

16:59.935 --> 17:01.979
OK, let's go.
好的，我们走吧。

17:02.062 --> 17:03.689
SpongeBob, what are you doing?
海绵宝宝，你在做什么？

17:03.772 --> 17:05.649
Why are you moving your
arms like that?
你为什么要移动你的
手臂就这样？

17:05.733 --> 17:07.192
I guess
they're happy.
我猜
他们很高兴。

17:07.276 --> 17:10.654
Squidward: Argh, hand 'em over.
章鱼哥：啊，把它们交出来。

17:10.738 --> 17:13.615
And the other one, come on.
另一位，来吧。

17:13.699 --> 17:15.784
Unh...
呃……

17:15.868 --> 17:17.703
Now, that's
more like it.
现在，那就是
更喜欢它。

17:17.786 --> 17:20.998
Gee, Squidward, with your arms
and legs doing all the work
哎呀，章鱼哥，用你的手臂
和腿做所有的工作

17:21.081 --> 17:22.416
I'm not really doing anything.
我其实什么也没做。

17:22.499 --> 17:23.792
I think I should help.
我想我应该帮忙。

17:23.876 --> 17:26.253
Are you questioning
my leadership?
你在质疑吗
我的领导？

17:26.336 --> 17:27.379
Well, I just...
嗯，我只是...

17:27.463 --> 17:29.048
OK, hand it over.
好的，交给吧。

17:29.131 --> 17:30.215
You know what, Squidward?
你知道吗，章鱼哥？

17:30.299 --> 17:31.717
What?
什么？

17:31.800 --> 17:33.886
I think I'm suffering
for my art now.
我想我很痛苦
现在为了我的艺术。

17:39.892 --> 17:41.727
Good gravy.
好肉汁。

17:41.810 --> 17:43.228
Get a load of the talent here.
在这里获得大量人才。

17:43.312 --> 17:44.813
Oh, please.
哦，拜托。

17:44.897 --> 17:48.901
Just wait until you see my
brilliant moves.
等你看到我的
精彩的动作。

17:48.984 --> 17:49.902
Ooh.
哦。

18:08.212 --> 18:10.923
Oh...
哦...

18:18.180 --> 18:19.932
Oh my goodness.
哦，我的天啊。

18:20.015 --> 18:23.519
I am honored to be in the
presence of such divine talent.
我很荣幸能够在
有如此神圣天赋的存在。

18:23.602 --> 18:25.062
Quit groveling.
别再卑躬屈膝了。

18:25.145 --> 18:26.438
Where
is your dignity?
哪里
你的尊严是什么？

18:26.522 --> 18:28.941
These losers are here
to worship us.
这些失败者都在这里
来崇拜我们。

18:29.024 --> 18:30.025
I mean me.
我是说我。

18:30.108 --> 18:31.610
By the end of the night
到了晚上结束的时候

18:31.693 --> 18:32.986
I'll have them
on their knees
我会拥有它们
跪下

18:33.070 --> 18:34.696
just begging for more.
只是乞求更多。

18:34.780 --> 18:36.949
Female:  : Now
that's what I like to call
女: : 现在
这就是我喜欢称呼的

18:37.032 --> 18:38.909
a hard act to follow.
这是一个很难遵循的行为。

18:38.992 --> 18:42.246
Next up, we have SpongeBob
SquarePants.
接下来，我们有海绵宝宝
方裤。

18:43.789 --> 18:44.832
Oh, man.
哦，伙计。

18:44.915 --> 18:46.083
I can't wait.
我等不及了。

18:46.166 --> 18:48.794
I am  so  stoked
on dancing right now.
我很兴奋
现在就跳舞。

18:50.587 --> 18:52.089
Now before I begin
在我开始之前

18:52.172 --> 18:54.842
let me just thank you all for
coming out tonight.
让我感谢你们所有人
今晚出来。

18:56.718 --> 18:58.804
Will you please stop it?
请你停下来好吗？

18:58.887 --> 19:00.973
And let my dancing
do the talking.
让我的舞蹈
说话。

19:06.854 --> 19:08.105
Wow, Squidward, the crowd's
gone silent.
哇，章鱼哥，人群的
沉默了。

19:08.188 --> 19:09.857
Of course they have.
当然有。

19:09.940 --> 19:13.902
They are in the presence
of a true artiste.
他们在场
一个真正的艺术家。

19:15.988 --> 19:17.698
What's he doing?
他在做什么？

19:17.781 --> 19:19.116
Is he hurt?
他受伤了吗？

19:19.199 --> 19:21.076
I don't know, man, but
it's hurting my eyes.
我不知道，伙计，但是
它伤害了我的眼睛。

19:21.159 --> 19:24.037
I think I'm gonna be sick.
我想我会生病。

19:25.247 --> 19:26.540
Uh, Squidward?
呃，章鱼哥？

19:26.623 --> 19:28.000
Ha, if they think that's good
哈，如果他们认为这样很好的话

19:28.083 --> 19:29.960
wait till they see...
等到他们看到...

19:34.298 --> 19:35.299
Cramp!
抽筋！

19:35.382 --> 19:38.594
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！

19:38.677 --> 19:41.054
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！

19:46.268 --> 19:48.145
Huh?
啊？

19:48.228 --> 19:49.396
Hey, guys, wait up.
嘿，伙计们，等等。

19:49.479 --> 19:50.439
Huh? What's this?
啊？这是什么？

19:51.690 --> 19:53.192
That's kind of nice.
这很好。

19:53.275 --> 19:55.444
Hey guys, come check this out.
嘿伙计们，快来看看这个吧。

20:02.951 --> 20:06.538
Must finish dance...
On other...
一定要跳完舞...
在其他...

20:12.544 --> 20:14.171
Um, Squidward,
is this part of the act?
嗯，章鱼哥，
这是该法案的一部分吗？

20:14.254 --> 20:18.008
The pain!
痛苦！

20:24.222 --> 20:26.934
By unanimous decision,
we have a winner.
经一致决定，
我们有一个胜利者。

20:27.017 --> 20:29.519
Mine!
矿！

20:30.562 --> 20:32.397
I won, I won!
我赢了，我赢了！

20:32.481 --> 20:35.150
Never before have
I seen such zest
以前从未有过
我看到了这样的热情

20:35.233 --> 20:36.401
such  joie de vivre.
这样的生活乐趣。

20:36.485 --> 20:38.278
Oh, thank you,
you're too kind.
哦，谢谢你，
你太善良了。

20:38.362 --> 20:43.617
But I couldn't have done it
without a very special someone.
但我做不到
没有一个非常特别的人。

20:43.700 --> 20:45.953
Wait, SpongeBob, no!
等等，海绵宝宝，不！

20:47.162 --> 20:49.665
The rulebook clearly states
规则手册明确规定

20:49.748 --> 20:51.166
"A single dancer must
perform
“一个舞者必须
执行

20:51.250 --> 20:53.794
without any further assistance
from a partner."
没有任何进一步的帮助
来自合作伙伴。”

20:53.877 --> 20:56.254
Therefore, you're the winner.
因此，你是赢家。

20:56.338 --> 20:59.675
Oh man, the jig's up, Pedro.
噢，伙计，一切都准备好了，佩德罗。

20:59.758 --> 21:01.426
We're goin' home.
我们要回家了

21:03.011 --> 21:06.473
It's all right,
I'll go call a taxi.
没关系，
我去叫出租车。

21:06.556 --> 21:08.183
Merciful Neptune.
仁慈的海王星。

21:08.266 --> 21:09.726
Are there any more cheaters?
难道还有更多骗子吗？

21:09.810 --> 21:13.146
Oh, crud, we're two dancers.
哦，天哪，我们是两个舞者。

21:13.230 --> 21:15.983
We're nine dancers actually.
实际上我们是九个舞者。

21:16.066 --> 21:17.776
Does this count?
这算不算？

21:17.859 --> 21:19.945
Isn't there
a single dancer here
没有吗
这里有一个舞者

21:20.028 --> 21:22.030
who is not assisted
by a partner?
谁没有得到帮助
由合作伙伴？

21:22.114 --> 21:25.534
Uh, what about number 52
over there?
呃，52号呢
在那儿？

21:31.206 --> 21:32.958
Is he alone?
他一个人吗？

21:33.041 --> 21:34.960
Patrick:
帕特里克：

21:35.043 --> 21:38.171
Why, yes,
he is a single dancer.
为什么，是的，
他是一名单身舞者。

21:38.255 --> 21:40.048
Oh, well, then.
哦，那么好吧。

21:41.383 --> 21:43.010
I guess he wins.
我猜他赢了。

21:45.971 --> 21:48.640
I love your new
dance, Patrick.
我喜欢你的新
跳舞吧，帕特里克。

21:51.560 --> 21:53.979
French Narrator: Epilogue.
法语旁白：尾声。

21:54.062 --> 21:55.981
Woman: Tommy?
女：汤米？

21:56.064 --> 21:57.983
I've got a fresh load
of laundr...
我有新的负载
洗衣房的...

22:00.068 --> 22:04.865
Tommy, oh, oh, dear me, no!
汤米，哦，哦，天哪，不！

22:04.948 --> 22:07.075
Hello, it's an emergency.
你好，情况紧急。

22:07.159 --> 22:08.785
My son! He's...
我的儿子！他是...

22:08.869 --> 22:11.538
Mom, calm down.
妈妈，冷静点。

22:13.081 --> 22:15.959
I'm just doing
"The Cramp"!
我只是在做
“抽筋”！

22:18.754 --> 22:20.338
Oh... Oh, you kids
哦...哦，你们这些孩子

22:20.422 --> 22:22.591
and your crazy dance fads.
还有你疯狂的舞蹈时尚。

22:25.302 --> 22:26.720
Hey, everybody.
嘿，大家。

22:26.803 --> 22:28.847
Let's all do "The Cramp"!
大家一起来做“抽筋”吧！

22:28.930 --> 22:29.848
Yeah!
是的！

是的！